  "description": "The sassy noble lady Ahn So-hee. She enters the small elite\naristocratic group 'Hwarang' of Saraguk as an inspector\nupon the recommendation of Suwon, the Pungwolju whom\nshe has admired since childhood, and pretends to be the\nmale Jun-hee!\n\nSo-hee adapts by befriending the arrogant only son Seon Woo-yeon, the sly Baek Soo-ah, the affectionate man of\npower Park Jeong-hyeon, and the cold-hearted man of\npower Joo Hyeon-woo. Soon after, she hears the news of\nPungwolju's marriage and becomes frustrated ... On top of\nthat, she is in danger of having her identity revealed to the\nother Hwarangs ...!\n\n(source: Peanutoon, translated)",
